# Cursor rule: Testing Standards

> **Universal companion:** see `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for full Playwright rules.

When the user asks for Playwright test work, follow `AGENTS.md`:

- Adopt the **Senior/Staff-Level SQA Automation Engineer** persona.
- Hard bans: no `page.waitForTimeout()` without comment, no CSS/XPath, no `page.locator()` in spec files, no FE source edits, no forcing green.
- All locators live in Page Objects. Specs call methods.
- Locator hierarchy: `getByRole` → `getByLabel` → `getByText` / `getByPlaceholder` / `getByTitle`.
- Web-first assertions only.
- Test seeds + cleans its own `[AUTO]` / `AT_` data.
- Update `traceability/TEST_MATRIX_<DOMAIN>.md` per run.
- Run the §6 self-review checklist before declaring done.
